  "headline": "Warfarin sodium is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 26 days on hand of 6 mg tablets and Corvale General has 18.8 days of 6 mg and 24.9 days of 2 mg; the best option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D2", "D3", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows warfarin sodium is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 272 tablets of the 6 mg presentation at 10.5 tablets per day, providing 26 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 189 tablets of the 6 mg presentation at 10 tablets per day, providing 18.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General also holds 266 tablets of the 2 mg presentation at 10.7 tablets per day, providing 24.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based recommendation ranks buying from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC as the first option; it is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Secondary options include Exelan Pharmaceuticals Inc. and Sun Pharmaceutical Industries, Inc., neither of which is on FDA's shortage list today and neither label names a plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    }
  ]
}
